<title>JAPAN: Hokubu Comm to issue 20 mln SFR CB.</title>
<headline>Hokubu Comm to issue 20 mln SFR CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Hokubu Communication &amp; Industrial Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Bank (Switzerland) Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO		AMT   20 million SFR</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE PAR	 MATURITY 30.Sep.00</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p>CONV FROM 14.Oct.96  CONV TO 18.Sep.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY	     PAY DATE 30.Sep.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 10.Sep.96 SUB DATE</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon, conversion price and currency rate will be decided on September 10</p>
